uctions for anyone to be able to understand."}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So you could express instructions for anyone to understand."}], "id": 1}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So you could read the instructions and understand them."}], "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So you could write expressions for anyone to understand."}], "id": 3, "text": ""}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "How could it be a good manual?"}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be long so people get bored."}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be extremely simple so it doesn't even work."}], "id": 1}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be everything but simple so people must think hard."}], "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Neither too long nor too simple, it must be clear so everyone could understand."}], "id": 3, "text": ""}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why is it important to add pictures and diagrams?"}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So you could inform the characteristics of the user to the product."}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So information is basically useless for the user."}], "id": 1}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So you could make the user understand easily how the product works."}], "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "So the product could be partially understood by the user."}], "id": 3, "text": ""}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "What could be the purpose of a user manual?"}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be a tool for the user to understand the instructions and the way to use the product."}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be the part of the product that is understandable by the designer."}], "id": 1}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be a book for the user to understand the designer ideas."}], "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It could be a tool for the designer to show how he bears in mind his products."}], "id": 3, "text": ""}], "id": 3}], "type": "DMC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "The Characteristics of a Good User Manual"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 1"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Select the correct answer."}, {"type": "text", "content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answer."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 2}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob09re4aud01"}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "seco